# Files excluded from the distributable plugin archive.
# Nothing reads this file automatically in this repo: `wp dist-archive` is not in
# our wp-cli.phar and there is no bin/build-zip.sh. The build recipe (git index +
# this list) is documented in docs.md §15.5. Everything not listed here ships.

